  "readmeFile": "docs\\README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Bug fix: value DateTime was written incorrectly to DWG, including the week number instead of day of week. This resulted in AutoCAD not displaying the date for regional long date (time) formats.\n- Bug fix: DxfTableCellContent did not set the Format.DataFlags and ContentFormatPropertyOverrideFlags during creation.\n- Bug fix: text line breaking behaves differently in a table cell (text may be broken at any point).\n- Reworked the DxfTable block generation, improved handling of merged cell ranges and merge table borders of the row/column pair adjacent to a border.\n- Added methods DxfTable.GetWidth() and GetHeight() to make it easier to position a table relative to e.g. a bottom corner instead of the top left.\n- DxfTableCellStyle.PropertyOverrideFlags now also calls the base DxfContentFormat PropertyOverrideFlags (masked with TableCellStylePropertyFlags.ContentPropertiesMask).",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "verbatimVersion": "10.0.2026.9091-trial",
